OL,3,GNEWSA'Pimping website' inquiry finds
OL,4,Ahuman trafficking 'hidden in plain
OL,5,Asight' online
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe report said such sites allowed
OL,8,Fcriminal gangs to manage multiple
OL,9,Fprofiles and conceal abuse behind the
OL,10,Fpretence of the women being
OL,11,Findependent.
